('Katja Grace', 'AI Impacts', NULL, '2015-04-06', 'year', '2022-08-13', 'year', 'https://web.archive.org/web/20150406054042/https://aiimpacts.org/about/ https://web.archive.org/web/20220813184622/https://aiimpacts.org/about/ https://web.archive.org/web/20221123052344/https://aiimpacts.org/about/', 'All five supplied snapshots (April and August 2015; March, April and May 2016) explicitly state that AIimpacts.org is written and maintained by Katja Grace and Paul Christiano. Formal title, joining date and employment type are unspecified. Start date records earliest supplied observation, not an exact joining date. June and July 2017 continue to describe writing and maintenance; October 2017 says Katja runs AI Impacts. No formal title is specified. Last supplied description without a formal title is August 13, 2022. Lead Researcher is first explicitly stated November 23, 2022. End date marks the last observation of the earlier description; the actual title transition is unspecified.', 'AGI organization', 'strategy', NULL, 'AI safety'), /*Closed*/
