('Rick Korzekwa', 'AI Impacts', 'Researcher', '2019-07-05', 'year', '2022-08-13', 'year', 'https://web.archive.org/web/20190705034232/https://aiimpacts.org/about/ https://web.archive.org/web/20220813184622/https://aiimpacts.org/about/ https://web.archive.org/web/20221123052344/https://aiimpacts.org/about/', 'First observed July 5, 2019. The March 2022 biography confirms he has been with AI Impacts since 2019, and the November 23, 2022 biography retrospectively states he started as a researcher in 2019. Last observed before the Director title August 13, 2022. End date records last observation of the earlier role, not the exact promotion date. Employment type unspecified.', 'AGI organization', 'strategy', NULL, 'AI safety'), /*Closed*/
('Daniel Kokotajlo', 'AI Impacts', NULL, '2019-07-05', 'year', '2021-12-07', 'year', 'https://web.archive.org/web/20190705034232/https://aiimpacts.org/about/ https://web.archive.org/web/20211207203218/https://aiimpacts.org/about/ https://web.archive.org/web/20220312004544/https://aiimpacts.org/about/', 'First listed among active contributors July 5, 2019; absent January 1, 2019. Actual joining date, formal title and employment type unspecified. Remains listed September 17 and November 14, 2019. Biography describes investigating the Agent AI versus Tool AI debate. April, May and August 2020 biographies describe experimenting with simulations as tools for modelling intelligence explosions; no formal title change is stated. Last observed as an active contributor December 7, 2021; explicitly listed under Past contributors March 12, 2022 and throughout the supplied later 2022 snapshots. End date records last observed active presence, not an exact departure date.', 'AGI organization', 'strategy', NULL, 'AI safety'), /*Closed*/
